{"unit_id":"TellToday__dsh-narrative-voice#card-zh","repo":"TellToday/dsh-narrative-voice","commit":"e30ca7e7cb97db8b84ce0fca461cf57993ea1251","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-user/narrative-voice 是一款面向 DSH 的提示词与命令插件：它在每次提示组装时找到 ask_user_question 工具，并为问题字段加入固定的人称规则，帮助问题和选项保持叙述视角一致。插件提供 /voice 命令，可启用或停用改写，也可切换回答者叙述和 AI 叙述两种方案；配置可设定默认方案及初始启用状态。规则只作用于该工具的问题描述，不改写普通回复或其他工具，适合希望让模型生成的选择题更清楚地区分提问者与回答者的 DSH 用户。无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:84-103","lib/index.js:110-143","cordis.patch.yml:13-18"]}
{"unit_id":"TellToday__dsh-narrative-voice#card-en","repo":"TellToday/dsh-narrative-voice","commit":"e30ca7e7cb97db8b84ce0fca461cf57993ea1251","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@dsh-user/narrative-voice adds a point-of-view rule to DSH’s ask_user_question tool during prompt assembly. Use /voice to toggle rewriting or switch between answerer and AI narration. It helps generated questions and choices make clear who is speaking. It affects this tool only and needs no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:84-103","lib/index.js:110-143","cordis.patch.yml:13-18"]}
