{"unit_id":"TellToday__dsh-narrative-voice#feature-rewrite","repo":"TellToday/dsh-narrative-voice","commit":"e30ca7e7cb97db8b84ce0fca461cf57993ea1251","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-user/narrative-voice 的功能「统一提问工具的人称」：提示组装时查找 ask_user_question，并给 questions 描述加入所选叙述规则，让问题和选项的人称映射保持清楚。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:84-103","lib/index.js:114-126"]}
